1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,650
A young girl with bright eyes discovers a hidden garden
behind her house.

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:09,570
She finds a small injured bird with colorful feathers lying
on the ground.

3
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:13,990
The girl gently picks up the bird and takes it to a safe
place.

4
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:18,129
She gives the bird some water and seeds to help it recover.

5
00:00:18,129 --> 00:00:22,899
The bird slowly opens its eyes and chirps happily at the
kind girl.

6
00:00:22,899 --> 00:00:27,339
Together they explore the magical flowers that glow in the
sunlight.

7
00:00:27,339 --> 00:00:31,530
The bird shows the girl a secret path through the garden
maze.

8
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:35,929
They become best friends and play together every sunny
afternoon.
